  "plain": "AARO, the Pentagon office set up in recent years to investigate UAP (the official term for UFOs), had by 2024 grown to around three or four dozen staff and had just been declared at full operational capability, according to a commentator named Marik von Rennenkampff. He describes it on the show alongside its pile of some 1,600 cases and a director, Jon Kosloski, who is said to be baffled by some of them, to show how small the office is next to the job."
